        "guard:b2->n10",
        "guard:b2->c2",
        "action:n10"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If tomato sauce is stolen, cook it."
      ],
      "justification": "Condition modeled as an explicit check node followed by an XOR split. Positive path cooks the sauce; negative path bypasses to convergence. Abstract variables (v2) preserve the original decision logic."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n11"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "After the sauce is cooked, combine all the meal components and prepare the meal."
      ],
      "justification": "Converges parallel paths, executes the final combination/preparation step, and reaches the process endpoint. Behaviour fully preserved."
    }
